      "seq": 9,
      "subject": "生物学",
      "subject_key": "biology",
      "stage": "初中（7-9年级）",
      "stage_key": "j1",
      "domain": "生物体的结构层次",
      "topic": "content",
      "type": "content",
      "text": "识别动植物细胞的结构并说出其异同点，说明细胞是生物体结构和功能的基本单位。",
      "source_page": 10,
      "source_pdf_page": 17,
      "source_id": "moe-cn-2022-biology"
    },
    {
      "uid": "bi-j1-con-196750d4",
      "seq": 11,
      "subject": "生物学",
      "subject_key": "biology",
      "stage": "初中（7-9年级）",
      "stage_key": "j1",
      "domain": "生物体的结构层次",
      "topic": "content",
      "type": "content",
      "text": "运用控制变量的方法，设计简单的实验，探究单细胞生物的运动或趋性。",
      "source_page": 10,
      "source_pdf_page": 17,
      "source_id": "moe-cn-2022-biology"
    },
    {
      "uid": "bi-j1-con-120416c9",
      "seq": 12,
      "subject": "生物学",
      "subject_key": "biology",
      "stage": "初中（7-9年级）",
      "stage_key": "j1",
      "domain": "生物体的结构层次",
      "topic": "content",
      "type": "content",
      "text": "描述细胞分裂和分化的基本过程；识别人体和植物体的主要组织；说明细胞通过分裂和分化形成各种组织，组织构成不同的器官。",
      "source_page": 10,
      "source_pdf_page": 17,
      "source_id": "moe-cn-2022-biology"
    },
    {
      "uid": "bi-j1-con-839ab831",
      "seq": 13,
      "subject": "生物学",
      "subject_key": "biology",
      "stage": "初中（7-9年级）",
      "stage_key": "j1",
      "domain": "生物体的结构层次",
      "topic": "content",
      "type": "content",
      "text": "识别给定生物材料所属的结构层次，并阐明生物体在结构和功能上是一个有机整体。",
      "source_page": 10,
      "source_pdf_page": 17,
      "source_id": "moe-cn-2022-biology"
    },
    {
